                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "Oc8BJ",
                                  "name": "Why is Enhancv the best online resume bu",
                                  "context": "TextPrimitive - h6",
                                  "height": 44,
                                  "layout": "vertical",
                                  "padding": [
                                    0,
                                    0,
                                    16,
                                    0
                                  ],
                                  "justifyContent": "center",
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "QxvdJ",
                                      "fill": "#6141c0",
                                      "content": "Why is Enhancv the best online resume builder?",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.27,
                                      "fontFamily": "Rubik",
                                      "fontSize": 22,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "frame",
                              "id": "cWPEE",
                              "name": "div",
                              "context": "div",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "height": 748.63,
                              "layout": "none",
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "K2OxK",
                                  "x": 0,
                                  "y": 3,
                                  "name": "More than 10 million job seekers have bu",
                                  "fill": "#161b1d",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 1291.16,
                                  "content": "More than 10 million job seekers have built resumes on Enhancv, and the outcomes reach across every level of the job market. Users have landed jobs at Amazon, Johnson & Johnson, Nokia, Samsung, Citi, HSBC, Ford, Dell, Salesforce, EY, PwC, Bosch, GE Vernova, Sanofi, and hundreds more. Across five",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "NeI0w",
                                  "x": 1000.37,
                                  "y": 28.59,
                                  "name": "independent preference studies",
                                  "context": "a",
                                  "fill": "#6141c0",
                                  "content": "independent preference studies",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "Z7S0rA",
                                  "x": 0,
                                  "y": 28.59,
                                  "name": "that cost over $100,000 to run, conducte",
                                  "fill": "#161b1d",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 1276.41,
                                  "content": "that cost over $100,000 to run, conducted by a third-party research agency, 60 to 80 percent of participants chose Enhancv over each major competitor. Here's what drives those outcomes:",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "frame",
                                  "id": "uruGy",
                                  "x": 0,
                                  "y": 118.37,
                                  "name": "ul",
                                  "context": "ul",
                                  "width": "fill_container(1296)",
                                  "layout": "vertical",
                                  "padding": [
                                    0,
                                    0,
                                    0,
                                    24
                                  ],
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "d2D7Ad",
                                      "name": "Enhancv is built for both readers your r",
                                      "context": "li",
                                      "fill": "#161b1d",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": 76.78,
                                      "content": "Enhancv is built for both readers your resume faces. Your resume is read twice. First, ATS software parses the structure and extracts your data. Then a recruiter or hiring manager decides whether to call you. Enhancv templates parse cleanly through applicant tracking systems (Workday, SuccessFactors, Greenhouse, and others) and hold attention when a person opens the file. You don't have to choose between a resume that clears the scan and one that earns the interview.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "u0WJb",
                                      "name": "Two-column templates clear ATS at top em",
                                      "context": "li",
                                      "fill": "#161b1d",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": 76.78,
                                      "content": "Two-column templates clear ATS at top employers. The most persistent myth in resume advice is that two-column formats fail ATS parsing. In our documented set of verified hires, 69% used a two-column template and still cleared employer ATS at Amazon, Citi, HSBC, Dell, and Salesforce. The formatting choice is not the barrier the common advice suggests.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "x7YCt",
                                      "name": "The AI assistant works inside the docume",
                                      "context": "li",
                                      "fill": "#161b1d",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": 102.38,
                                      "content": "The AI assistant works inside the document, not in a separate tab. Other builders send you to a separate interface or offer a fixed menu of preset prompts. With Enhancv, you type what you want in plain language and the edits appear inline, in the right section, without switching context. Rewrite a bullet, sharpen a summary, suggest skills for a specific role, or improve the readability of any section. The edit appears directly in your resume. The tailoring engine works the same way: paste a job description and the resume adjusts around it.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "gBJI2",
                                      "name": "The ATS Check is built on real hiring sy",
                                      "context": "li",
                                      "fill": "#161b1d",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": 51.19,
                                      "content": "The ATS Check is built on real hiring system data. The feedback draws from over 200 hours of recruiter interviews and hundreds of pages of ATS documentation, covering what hiring systems flag. You get specific, actionable findings for your resume, not a generic score and a list of keywords to scatter somewhere.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "aKy2L",
                                      "name": "Content quality is held to a professiona",
                                      "context": "li",
                                      "fill": "#161b1d",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": 76.78,
                                      "content": "Content quality is held to a professional standard. Certified Professional Resume Writers (CPRWs) review every resume example and piece of guidance on Enhancv. The suggestions, examples, and improvements you encounter in the builder reflect what credentialed career professionals would recommend. The AI does the work. Humans set the standard.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "c4ZGY",
                                      "name": "A template range that fits every profess",
                                      "context": "li",
                                      "fill": "#161b1d",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": 76.78,
                                      "content": "A template range that fits every professional field. Eleven templates appear in the verified hire set. At Shell, GE Vernova, and Citi, users chose restrained single-column formats. At Samsung, Dell, and Amazon, they chose structured two-column layouts. From finance, law, and government to software, marketing, and design, the range covers every field and seniority level.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "KiqZl",
                                      "name": "Built for the full job search. The resum",
                                      "context": "li",
                                      "fill": "#161b1d",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "height": 76.78,
                                      "content": "Built for the full job search. The resume builder connects to a cover letter builder with matching templates. A Job Application Tracker helps you stay organized and scores your resume against the job description in real time. The Resume Checker flags compatibility issues before you apply. Everything works from the same account, with cloud storage for up to 300 documents so you can maintain tailored versions for multiple applications.",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                      "fontSize": 16,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "opWsi",
                                  "x": 0,
                                  "y": 674.84,
                                  "name": "The user base spans the full range of th",
                                  "fill": "#161b1d",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 1293.34,
                                  "content": "The user base spans the full range of the job market. Top fields include software engineering, sales, marketing, data analysis, finance, healthcare, supply chain, and project management. Senior and executive-level users make up a significant share, and although the common belief is that Enhancv is just for creatives, design-forward roles account for fewer than 2% of verified hires. Enhancv is used across every career level and industry.",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
