                                  "content": "We do support multiple languages outside of English, and these include: Spanish, French, German, Italian, Swedish, Portuguese, Dutch, Danish, Finnish, Czech, Polish, and Norwegian. You can also seamlessly switch between languages within the app, without having to make a new registration.",
