                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": 1275.87,
                                  "content": "Hiring managers and applicant tracking systems (ATS) look for resumes that match the job description. A generic resume gets ignored, while a tailored one highlights the skills and experiences the company actually needs-boosting your chances of landing an interview.\n\nWith Enhancv’s One-Click Resume Tailoring, you can instantly adapt your resume to any job description in seconds.",
