                                                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                                              "width": "fill_container",
                                                              "height": 29.66,
                                                              "content": "• Executed website redesign of kaplancleantech.com using Expression Engine as a CMS while working with marketing and sales teams. Optimized 3 landing page variants using HTML, A/B testing software and customer feedback to increase leads for sales teams.",
                                                              "lineHeight": 1.55,
