                                                              "fill": "#545454",
                                                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
                                                              "width": "fill_container",
                                                              "height": 29.66,
                                                              "content": "• Executed Google Analytics tracking campaigns to maximize the effectiveness of 5 email re-marketing initiatives deployed using Salesforce software. Used Salesforce Object Query Language, C, and Python to search for data for specific information.",
